  "description": "Makes good as a maneuverable singlespeed city bike with fenders but also fixie tracklocrosser with knobby tires.\n\nYou like minimalism, but still want a bike that “can do everything”? Then you are exactly right with the NEUKLN. It can be built as a nimble singlespeed city bike with fenders but also fixed gear tracklocrosser with lugged tires.\n\nThrough the new head tube you can build it either with our durable steel fork, but also with our lightweight carbon fork.\n\nThe NEUKLN V2 offers you a minimalist design combined with useful features. The design is even sleeker and tidier than ever before. Thanks to the internal cable routing hidden on the top tube, the NEUKLN looks good with, but also without brakes.\n\nLike every 8bar model, NEUKLN refers to a district in Berlin. It is an abbreviation for Neukölln, which is very popular especially in the creative scene. It is known as a rough, hip district – just like the NEUKLN.\n\nSTEEL FRAME\n\nThe 8bar NEUKLN STEEL v1 comes with double-butted 8bar CrMo tubing. CrMo frames have the advantage to be more flexible and giving you more comfort on your rides compared to our aluminium frames.\n\nINTERNAL CABLE ROUTING\n\nThe new NEUKLN STEEL v1 comes with internal cable routing for a clean and tidy look.\n\nCAGE MOUNT\n\nA bottle cage mounting option gives you an easy possibility to carry something to drink on your ride.\n\nFENDER MOUNTS\n\nFRONT RACK X FENDER MOUNTS\n\nCUSTOM DROPOUTS\n\nSleek custom dropouts with stamped 8bar logo gives your bike a unique look\n\nINTEGRATED SEATCLAMP\n\nThe integrated seatpost not only looks visually stylish. It also makes your bike lighter and clamps the seatpost not only at one point.",
